# What a working checkout has and a clean clone does not. The patterns above
# match at the root only, so without these a build from a developer's folder
# sends the agent worktrees — each a full checkout with its own node_modules
# and its own .env.local — into the build stage, keys and all.
.claude
supabase/.temp
*.md
!README.md
docs
